     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Aki,<br><br>Many thanks.<br><br>Just to be clear:<br><br>if I want to make inference about s then, I should draw from the following?<br><br><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">multi_normal(k_s(X_tilde, X) * A * y</font>, <font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">k_s(X_tilde, X_tilde) – S_tilde * A * t(S_tilde))<br><br><br><br></font></div>"
    ],
